{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About demo Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to chaos and adrenaline! Inspired by <strong>90s hip-hop culture</strong>, this <strong>fast-paced first-person shooter</strong> takes you to the gritty streets where <strong>time, money, and survival</strong> are all that matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every 20 seconds, the rules change.</strong> First, enemies become <strong>invisible</strong> \u2013 you can\u2019t see them, but you can hear every <strong>footstep, reload, and whisper</strong>. <strong>Loot, grab cash, and prepare for battle!</strong> Then, the next 20-second phase begins \u2013 <strong>everyone is visible, and brutal shootouts erupt!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your goal</strong> \u2013 collect enough money to activate the <strong>portal and escape</strong>\u2026 or stay and <strong>prove your dominance!</strong> Play <strong>solo or in teams</strong>, deciding when to <strong>risk it all or make your getaway.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Dynamic gameplay with shifting phases</strong> \u2013 every <strong>20 seconds</strong>, the game flips: <strong>invisibility for looting and prep, visibility for intense combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>No ammo worries</strong> \u2013 weapons reload <strong>automatically</strong>, so you can focus on the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa <strong>1 unique map</strong> \u2013 master the battlefield and use every corner to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Different game modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Battles</strong> \u2013 fight in <strong>5v5, 4v4, 3v3, or chaotic 2v2v2 matches.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Random events and bonuses</strong> \u2013 <strong>cash drops, power-ups, and traps</strong> appear mid-game to shake up the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for <strong>insane gunfights, unpredictable action, and the raw energy of the 90s?</strong> Pick your weapon, collect <strong>crystals</strong>, and <strong>fight for victory!</strong> \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udca5</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513170?t=1757636113","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757636113","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513170/ee7381a6f8007b71cd211a26caaa05c898c22f2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757636113","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513170/ee7381a6f8007b71cd211a26caaa05c898c22f2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757636113","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About demo Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to chaos and adrenaline! Inspired by <strong>90s hip-hop culture</strong>, this <strong>fast-paced first-person shooter</strong> takes you to the gritty streets where <strong>time, money, and survival</strong> are all that matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every 20 seconds, the rules change.</strong> First, enemies become <strong>invisible</strong> \u2013 you can\u2019t see them, but you can hear every <strong>footstep, reload, and whisper</strong>. <strong>Loot, grab cash, and prepare for battle!</strong> Then, the next 20-second phase begins \u2013 <strong>everyone is visible, and brutal shootouts erupt!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your goal</strong> \u2013 collect enough money to activate the <strong>portal and escape</strong>\u2026 or stay and <strong>prove your dominance!</strong> Play <strong>solo or in teams</strong>, deciding when to <strong>risk it all or make your getaway.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Dynamic gameplay with shifting phases</strong> \u2013 every <strong>20 seconds</strong>, the game flips: <strong>invisibility for looting and prep, visibility for intense combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>No ammo worries</strong> \u2013 weapons reload <strong>automatically</strong>, so you can focus on the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa <strong>1 unique map</strong> \u2013 master the battlefield and use every corner to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Different game modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Battles</strong> \u2013 fight in <strong>5v5, 4v4, 3v3, or chaotic 2v2v2 matches.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Random events and bonuses</strong> \u2013 <strong>cash drops, power-ups, and traps</strong> appear mid-game to shake up the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for <strong>insane gunfights, unpredictable action, and the raw energy of the 90s?</strong> Pick your weapon, collect <strong>crystals</strong>, and <strong>fight for victory!</strong> \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udca5</p>","developers":["Alt + F4"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3432120","name":"Hiding"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513170/f81b4d76b264f7b0b1fe85557d3afadd75c11662/header.jpg?t=1757636113","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"